olutely meet our team! We have an incredibly talented group of professionals here. We are all very excited to be on this project. You've got to come to our downtown office to see for yourself! You'll love how creative we are!"}, {"time": "32500", "image": "engenn6le05ob01re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: Excuse me, would you mind taking your call outside? Your conversation is bothering other patrons.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Steve</span>: Can't you see I'm on the phone? I'm closing a deal here. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: I understand, sir, but this restaurant has a policy about cell phones. Patrons should have their phones on silent mode as a courtesy to others."}, {"time": "53800", "image": "engenn6le05ob01re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Steve</span>: I'm one of your regulars. I come here every week for business lunches. Can I finish this call in peace? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: I'm afraid not, sir. I'm going to have to ask you to turn your phone off. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Steve</span>: This is ridiculous! I demand to see the manager!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa and The Rude Customer"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Turn It OFF"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Food for Thought > Recipe - Chocolate Chip Cookies"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 5}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations"}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le05ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Dealing with Customers"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you work in a restaurant or in a shop, it is important to deal with customers properly.<br/><br/>Remember to respond to their requests politely and to use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span>  to suggest something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to deal with customers:<br/><br/><ul><li>You might want to ... </li><li>Would you mind ... ?</li><li>You should ... </li><li>You ought to ...  (strong request)</li>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>You might want to ... </li><li>Would you mind ... ?</li><li>You should ... </li><li>May I ... </li><li>You ought to ... (strong request)</li>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I understand, sir/madam, but ... </li><li>I'm afraid not</li><li>I apologize, but ... </li>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Would you mind turning your phone off?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Can't you see I'm busy? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: I understand, sir, but your conversation is bothering other patrons."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing What is Necessary"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use modals such as <span class=\"italic\">should</span> and <span class=\"italic\">must</span> to express that something is necessary to do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Should expresses mild obligation or advice.<br> Must and expressions with have to express strong advice. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Patrons should have their phones on silent mode as a courtesy to others."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You must absolutely meet our team!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "You've got to come to our downtown office to see for yourself! "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "incredibly"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to a great degree"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have an incredibly creative team."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob01aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear in a phone conversation."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "talented "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "showing talent; gifted; skillful "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our team is incredibly talented."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob01aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to bother "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to disturb "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You are bothering other customers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob01aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "patron "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a regular customer at a restaurant or store"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your loud conversation is bothering other patrons."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob01aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to close a deal"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to conclude a business agreement"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can't you see I'm on the phone? I'm closing a deal!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob01aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "policy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "rules; guidelines"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our restaurant has a policy about cell phones."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob01aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "regular "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a customer who regularly goes to the same restaurant or store "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm one of your regulars. I come here every week for lunch."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob01aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to turn something off"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to stop using something, usually an electronic device "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am going to have to ask you to turn your phone off. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob01aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Role-play a situation at a restaurant. Choose between the following roles:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are a waiter or waitress. You are very patient and deal with a difficult customer.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" You are a rude customer. You have difficult requests for the waiter or waitress. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue (12-14 lines) about the situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the dialogue aloud."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles with your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue about dealing with difficult customers."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I offer suggestions and respond politely."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express what is necessary and refuse politely."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I role-play the dialogue in front of others."}]}]}